Build Configuration:
BB_VERSION           = "2.8.1"
BUILD_SYS            = "x86_64-linux"
NATIVELSBSTRING      = "universal"
TARGET_SYS           = "arm-poky-linux-gnueabi"
MACHINE              = "beaglebone"
DISTRO               = "poky"
DISTRO_VERSION       = "5.0.15"
TUNE_FEATURES        = "arm armv7a vfp thumb neon callconvention-hard"
TARGET_FPU           = "hard"

Author: desmtiny <nguyenhoangminhdo@gmail.com>

Build Workspace

Install Package:
sudo apt-get -y install gawk wget git-core diffstat unzip texinfo gcc-multilib \
     build-essential chrpath socat cpio python3 python3-pip python3-pexpect \
     libsdl1.2-dev xterm make xsltproc docbook-utils fop dblatex xmlto

Source Clone:
git clone -b scarthgap git://git.yoctoproject.org/poky/
 
cd poky
 
git clone -b scarthgap git://git.openembedded.org/meta-openembedded
 
git clone -b scarthgap git://git.yoctoproject.org/meta-ti
 
git clone -b scarthgap https://git.yoctoproject.org/meta-arm

Install Build Env:	
source oe-init-build-env build-bbb

Select Machine:	
vim ./build-bbb/conf/local.conf
change: MACHINE ?= “beaglebone”	

Add source Path:
vim ./build-bbb/conf/bblayers.conf

POKY_BBLAYERS_CONF_VERSION = "2"

BBPATH = "${TOPDIR}"
BBFILES ?= ""

BBLAYERS ?= " \
  /home/desmtiny/workspace/BBBImage/Yocto/poky/meta \
  /home/desmtiny/workspace/BBBImage/Yocto/poky/meta-poky \
  /home/desmtiny/workspace/BBBImage/Yocto/poky/meta-yocto-bsp \
  /home/desmtiny/workspace/BBBImage/Yocto/poky/meta-openembedded/meta-oe \
  /home/desmtiny/workspace/BBBImage/Yocto/poky/meta-arm/meta-arm-toolchain \
  /home/desmtiny/workspace/BBBImage/Yocto/poky/meta-arm/meta-arm \
  /home/desmtiny/workspace/BBBImage/Yocto/poky/meta-ti/meta-ti-bsp \
  /home/desmtiny/workspace/BBBImage/Yocto/poky/meta-ti/meta-ti-extras \
  /home/desmtiny/workspace/BBBImage/Yocto/poky/meta-ti/meta-beagle \
  "

Build: 
		
bitbake core-image-minimal

Clone Github Repo
cd poky
mkdir meta-bbb
cd meta-bbb
git clone https://github.com/unmeiongaku/yocto-beaglebone-black

Apply path:
/home/desmtiny/workspace/BBBImage/Yocto/poky/meta-bbb \

Rebuild:
cd ./poky/build-bbb
bitbake core-image-minimal

